** All [[Transformation ability|transformation-based abilities]]' notes apply. More information can be found [[Rubick#Transformation Sources|here]].
** In short, {{A|Terrorblade|Metamorphosis}}-based abilities takes precedence over all transformation sources.

* The following notes apply for other mechanics upon losing the acquired ability, unless explicitly stated:
** Losing the {{M|channeling}} ability usually ends the channel time prematurely.
** {{M|Sub-ability}} of abilities are automatically acquired and takes the same slot.
